title: "MFAR Modular Google Colab Pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hardiyanto"
    affiliation: "Department of Maritime, Politeknik Negeri Bengkalis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yanto-mashardi/MFAR_Modular_Colab_Pipeline"
url: "https://github.com/yanto-mashardi/MFAR_Modular_Colab_Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline penelitian modular untuk transformasi data AIS, pembentukan grid waktu,
  monitoring keadaan operasional, forecast tanpa intervensi, fuzzification,
  evaluasi rule Mamdani, dan evaluasi skenario tindakan pada layanan feri Ro-Ro
  jarak pendek.
keywords:
  - Automatic Identification System
  - Ro-Ro ferry
  - maritime operations
  - fuzzy inference
  - reproducible research
